        "output": "Independent (rho=0.0): Decentralized = 1643.2 units, Centralized = 821.6 units (Savings: 50.0%)\nCorrelated  (rho=0.6): Decentralized = 1643.2 units, Centralized = 1374.8 units (Savings: 16.33%)"
