          "Ultimately, real-time hazard detection and automated remediation transform cold chain logistics from an uncertain gamble into a self-healing biological transport network. By catching thermal deviations early, dispatching targeted physical interventions, and validating residual stability budgets, operations executives protect critical pharmaceutical shipments and safeguard human lives across global healthcare supply chains."
