        "tryIt": "In the Bills of Resources (BOR) and Product Load Profiles: Translating Master Production Schedules into Work-Center Hours code editor, adjust Bills (currently 47) and Resources to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
