        "tryIt": "In the Berth Allocation Problem (BAP) and Quay Crane Scheduling Problem (QCSP): Combinatorial Formulations code editor, adjust Berth (currently 53) and Allocation to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
